(b) Patch Files must contain only your changes and minimal necessary context.
(c) Patch Files must not include substantial portions of the original Software.
(d) Recipients must have a lawful copy of the original Software to apply the patch.
(e) Patch Files must clearly reference the original Software and contain a notice stating that the Patch is governed by this License.

**Prohibited Sharing:**

(a) Modified source code or source trees.
